  sectionTitle:'Sharper designs. A mailbox with breathing room.',
  sectionIntro:'Fix a blurry Canva export, or work out what to remove when Gmail storage is full. Two practical guides with comparison tables, worked examples and credited archive photographs.',
  updateHtml:'<h2>Two illustrated guides to Canva exports and Gmail storage</h2><p>Added a <a href="/posts/canva-download-blurry-png-jpg-pdf/">Canva export troubleshooting guide</a> with a pixel-budget example and a controlled comparison worksheet, and a <a href="/posts/gmail-storage-full-find-large-emails/">Gmail storage guide</a> with search examples, preservation checks and a fictional cleanup calculation. Both distinguish official product guidance from KYD editorial examples and include licensed archive photographs. <a href="/posts/#everyday-selection">Topic-selection evidence</a> is recorded separately from the article claims.</p>',
